.TH geectl-build-wait-for-results 1  "geectl-build-wait-for-results 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-build\-wait\-for\-results \- Poll the build results until they settle, or the deadline passes
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl build wait\-for\-results\fR [\fB\-\-package\fR] [\fB\-\-repository\fR] [\fB\-\-arch\fR] [\fB\-\-code\fR] [\fB\-\-multibuild\fR] [\fB\-\-locallink\fR] [\fB\-\-lastbuild\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-deadline\-secs\fR> <\fIPROJECT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Poll the build results until they settle, or the deadline passes
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-package\fR \fI<PACKAGE>\fR
Only this package\*(Aqs statuses (the repository/architecture cells still come back whole)
.TP
\fB\-\-repository\fR \fI<REPOSITORY>\fR
Only these repositories (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-arch\fR \fI<ARCH>\fR
Only these architectures (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-code\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Only packages with this build code (e.g. `failed`)
.TP
\fB\-\-multibuild\fR
Expand multibuild flavors into their own statuses
.TP
\fB\-\-locallink\fR
Follow local links when expanding multibuild flavors
.TP
\fB\-\-lastbuild\fR
The last build\*(Aqs results instead of the current state
.TP
\fB\-\-deadline\-secs\fR \fI<DEADLINE_SECS>\fR
Deadline in seconds: the wait fails with a timeout past it
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>
The project to poll
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
